Born in Safad, northern Palestine,[ around] 1888-1890, Abbo was a[ farmer] and fisherman who later took up carpentry and stone m[asonry]. It was not[ until] he moved to[ Berlin] in 1911 to study[ sculpture] that his artistic career took shape.
